Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.91,0:00:01.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ponder this!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.19,0:00:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What walks on four legs in the morning, two\Nduring midday, and three in the evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So goes the riddle of the Sphinx, the\Nlegendary guardian of the pyramids.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.53,0:00:14.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The answer? Man!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.61,0:00:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Travelers who answer the riddle incorrectly\Nare devoured by the ravenous Sphinx.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:23.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, 30,000 kilometers from Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.73,0:00:27.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and crew have finally\Nreached their destination, Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.53,0:00:28.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo is massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.11,0:00:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in our best interest to\Nsystematically search the city,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,working our way toward the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.81,0:00:41.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're finally here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.59,0:00:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro and the others have reached Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.89,0:00:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.97,0:00:53.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,before the team can reach Dio,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.03,0:00:58.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they must first navigate their way through\Nthe many sphinxes that stand before them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very nice to meet you, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.79,0:01:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What'll you have to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.31,0:01:16.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something we'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.93,0:01:21.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My associates and I are trying\Nto locate this building.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.11,0:01:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Any idea where it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.55,0:01:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joseph and the others\Nwere utterly exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.85,0:01:28.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They had been searching\Nfor the building in the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.69,0:01:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,photograph ever since\Ntheir arrival in Cairo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.23,0:01:37.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Taken with Joseph's psychic photography,\Nthe image revealed Dio's whereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.61,0:01:41.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dio had recently moved to a new hideout,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.15,0:01:43.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Speedwagon\NFoundation couldn't find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.13,0:01:45.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where was Dio hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.69,0:01:51.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Failure to locate him as soon as possible\Nwould spell certain doom for Holly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.33,0:01:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, stranger, but this is a cafe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.01,0:01:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should order a drink\Nbefore asking questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.97,0:02:01.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then iced teas, four of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.21,0:02:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never seen the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.47,0:02:28.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo is a city of six\Nmillion so there must
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.09,0:02:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be at least two or\Nthree million buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:35.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we gonna find him we know he's\Nhere there must be someone who can help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.87,0:02:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the building huh this picture\Ndoesn't tell me anything sorry man but it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.77,0:02:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doesn't look familiar.\NI see. Sorry to bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you let's go we'll try somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I happen to know where your\Nlittle building is located.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:06.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest with you i'm\Nquite familiar with it.
