Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.77,0:03:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end
Dialogue: 1,0:03:22.49,0:03:25.32,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,953)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.01,0:03:30.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.23,0:03:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.21,0:03:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the man who has been sent\Nto me, the king of the king
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.81,0:03:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the king of the\Nking has been no longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.15,0:03:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The place at the end of the\Nworld is still a place to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.19,0:04:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Following the war, the end\Nof the battle of the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.95,0:04:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The way you die is the star of the star?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:21.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.73,0:04:25.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,end
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.51,0:04:30.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.07,0:04:41.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola, ola, ola, ola!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.70,0:04:42.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ola,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.62,0:04:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ola,
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.04,0:04:56.00,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(479,477)\pos(159,871)}Episode 34: D'Arby the Gambler, Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.25,0:04:53.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ola!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.16,0:04:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:56.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were you the one who said that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.31,0:04:58.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you actually know\Nwhere the building is?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.97,0:05:00.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.17,0:05:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The exact location of\Nthe building in question
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.95,0:05:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is information readily available to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you serious? That's incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.31,0:05:11.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What remarkable news! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.73,0:05:13.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are the odds that\Nwe would stumble upon
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.47,0:05:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,someone who knows exactly\Nwhere the building is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.15,0:05:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't keep us in suspense.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's it located?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.47,0:05:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you really expecting\Nsomething for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.03,0:05:31.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you bring up a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.97,0:05:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.88,0:05:34.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten pounds for your help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.67,0:05:36.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.29,0:05:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.53,0:05:44.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thing is, I'm something of a gambling man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.61,0:05:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been known to be a\Nsucker for cheap thrills,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.11,0:05:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and some would even go so\Nfar as to say I'm an addict.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.05,0:05:53.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, when all's said and done,\Ngambling's how I make my living.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.41,0:05:57.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, any of you boys like to gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.31,0:06:00.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure I fully understand\Nwhat you're trying to get at.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:02.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd laid it out plainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.13,0:06:05.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't like gambling, then say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.27,0:06:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the last time, I have no idea\Nwhere you're going with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.99,0:06:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What I'm asking is if you and your\Nfriends would like to play a little game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.31,0:06:17.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win, and I'll tell you the\Nlocation of your building.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.49,0:06:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's as simple as that. A bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.15,0:06:22.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, friend, I'm as\Nlucky as the next guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.33,0:06:25.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid that we don't\Nhave time for poker right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.09,0:06:27.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I throw in another 20\Npounds, will you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.01,0:06:29.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No need to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.23,0:06:31.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A bet can be anything, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.47,0:06:32.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't take very long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.11,0:06:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, take a look\Nat that wall over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see that cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.59,0:06:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, two pieces of dried fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:49.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Question is, which of the\Ntwo will the cat eat first?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.79,0:06:53.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The right one or the left one?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:57.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must say, there's something\Nthrilling about its simplicity.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.19,0:06:59.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.10,0:07:01.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've had just about enough of your games.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.39,0:07:04.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So take the money and tell us\Nwhat we want to know, you bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.79,0:07:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it down a notch, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.59,0:07:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not the way you\Nask someone for a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.51,0:07:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:12.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it'll make you shut\Nup, I'll take the bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.37,0:07:14.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cat will choose the\Npiece of fish on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.99,0:07:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.90,0:07:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now it's getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.15,0:07:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be placing my bet on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.59,0:07:21.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.55,0:07:25.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say, Jotaro, are you getting\Na strange feeling from him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.57,0:07:26.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He might be an enemy stand user.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.49,0:07:32.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That or he could just\Nbe a compulsive gambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.59,0:07:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he does anything at\Nall that seems suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.43,0:07:38.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should immediately attack\Nhim with Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.13,0:07:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.95,0:07:41.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's say I lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.33,0:07:44.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's fairly obvious that I'll\Nowe you a hefty amount of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.21,0:07:45.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when a hundred pounds do...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.71,0:07:47.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've no use for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.69,0:07:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what would you say\Nto giving me your soul?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That should do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:53.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the bastard thinks he's a comedian.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.55,0:08:01.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish we could get the hell out\Nof here and away from this freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:01.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.06,0:08:03.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, that's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.97,0:08:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll do things your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.67,0:08:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears the cat has\Ntaken notice of the fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.55,0:08:13.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.75,0:08:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going after the one on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I were a cat, I'd pick\Nthe bigger piece of meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.25,0:08:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And lucky for me, that's\Nthe one on the right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.67,0:08:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And there you have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.23,0:08:40.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our feline friend took the\Nleft, then the right, then ran.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.75,0:08:42.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I win this round, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.63,0:08:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, you've outdone yourself\Nthis time, Polnareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you're thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.04,0:08:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How exactly are we going\Nto get the information
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.31,0:08:50.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on the building's\Nwhereabouts out of him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.39,0:08:56.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if there's nothing else, as per\Nour agreement, it's time to pay up. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.09,0:08:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay? With what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.95,0:09:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your soul, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.59,0:09:04.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you didn't forget\Nabout our wager, Nareff.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.07,0:09:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want your soul, as I'm a stand user\Nwho prides himself on stealing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.71,0:09:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I find that it's far easier to take a\Nperson's soul if they lose it in a bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.05,0:09:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is when my stance power\Nactivates and collects what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.99,0:09:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
