Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.57,0:09:32.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now, I wouldn't be so\Nquick to lash out if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.33,0:09:35.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you desperately want\Nto kill me, but if I die,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.77,0:09:37.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff will meet the same end.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.31,0:09:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.95,0:09:43.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He has no pulse!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.73,0:09:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.67,0:09:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.93,0:09:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:09.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.85,0:10:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polnareff's soul resides in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.77,0:10:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Lord Dio has one less meddlesome\Nfool to interfere with his plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.31,0:10:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what a fool he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.85,0:10:22.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please allow me to introduce myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.89,0:10:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name is Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:28.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.35,0:10:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's an apostrophe after the D.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.81,0:10:36.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambler, Stealer of Defeated Souls,\Nand User of the Osiris Stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.95,0:10:44.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe you've had the\Npleasure of meeting my cat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:45.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.85,0:10:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You call that a bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.57,0:10:51.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you, you vile\Ncheating son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.87,0:10:52.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cheater, you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.91,0:10:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you considered\NPolnareff lost because he
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.61,0:10:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,lacked insight to consider\Nall the possibilities?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.17,0:11:00.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.55,0:11:02.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gambling is nothing more\Nthan a simple analogy
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,for man's relationship with his brethren.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.97,0:11:08.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A dance of deception, where\Nthe loser cries first. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.65,0:11:13.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you planning to kill me\Nwith your own two hands, Avdol?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.31,0:11:16.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead, if you don't mind\Nyour friend's soul being lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.07,0:11:20.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The choice is completely\Nup to you. Know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.43,0:11:24.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're not just going to let you\Nwaltz out of here in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.17,0:11:28.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to think back to September\NKnight, 1984 at 11.15pm.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.19,0:11:32.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember what you were doing\Nduring that time and date?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.09,0:11:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does that even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.67,0:11:37.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I remember it quite clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.51,0:11:41.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was in California,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.17,0:11:44.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gambling against an American that\Nwent by the name of Stephen Moore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.93,0:11:47.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said the same thing you\Njust said a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.75,0:11:54.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now he's singing a more silent tune.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.77,0:11:59.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The chip below him is his father,\Nand the one next to him is his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.01,0:12:05.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you want Polnareff's soul back, you\Nhave no choice but to continue our game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:08.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much is his life worth to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.91,0:12:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is evil incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.27,0:12:13.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.41,0:12:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants to capture our souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.97,0:12:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.71,0:12:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can leave if you're\Ntoo scared to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.15,0:12:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold Polnareff here for safekeeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.71,0:12:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't you fine gentlemen have a\Ndrink and think things over a bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Care for a piece of chocolate?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.87,0:12:50.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this, Mr. Joestar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.91,0:12:52.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you trying to accomplish?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.59,0:12:54.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.73,0:12:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea what\Nsurface tension is, Barbie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.11,0:12:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.13,0:13:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know it's not Barbie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.45,0:13:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I assume you're\Nreferring to how the liquor
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.83,0:13:07.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,appears to almost overflow\Nbut stays in the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.81,0:13:10.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, is there a point to all this build-up?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.39,0:13:11.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.93,0:13:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rules are simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.09,0:13:15.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We take turns dropping\Ncoins into the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoever makes the liquor\Nspill loses. Old man. Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.93,0:13:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, you're not going to...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:24.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.95,0:13:26.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bet my soul!
