Dialogue: 3,0:13:32.93,0:13:33.97,Eyecatch2 - Top,signbot,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\pos(1485,781.857)\shad1.5\4a&HFF&}D'Arby Elder
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.43,0:13:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Exactly right!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.63,0:13:38.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to bet my soul! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.41,0:13:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't go through with it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.52,0:13:44.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man is a good-for-nothing cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.17,0:13:45.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He won't cheat me this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:47.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided on the rules\Nmyself, so I'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:50.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you watch for funny business.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.43,0:13:52.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:55.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you're so determined,\NI'll accept your conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:14:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, before we begin, would you\Nmind if I inspect the glass and coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.67,0:14:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, have at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.29,0:14:06.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have the right to ensure that\NI'm playing on the up and up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.87,0:14:13.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A question.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.15,0:14:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What guarantee do I have that you'll return\NPolnareff's soul if you lose the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.21,0:14:24.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've my word as a\Ngambler that I'll keep my
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.67,0:14:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,promise if I lose I assure\Nyou that I will pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.85,0:14:32.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In full but I won't lose\Nwell in that case you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can go first go ahead and\Ndrop a coin in please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.53,0:14:40.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop just leave everything\Nto me the old coin
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.09,0:14:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in glass trick is one of\Nmy specialties surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.41,0:14:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This tension is a\Nsurprisingly strong force.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.23,0:14:49.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's room for at least eight\Nor nine coins in the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.79,0:14:53.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just have to stay calm and\Nmake sure my fingers don't shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.21,0:14:57.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it all right if I drop in more\Nthan one coin at the same time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.07,0:15:00.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as they all go\Nin at once. Well then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.01,0:15:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.92,0:15:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.87,0:15:06.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that'll create a wave on the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.23,0:15:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quiet, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.09,0:15:10.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take your hands off the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.07,0:15:38.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes nerves of steel to\Nput in five coins at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.41,0:15:45.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I'll go with one coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.29,0:15:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too close to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.55,0:15:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Typical old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.21,0:15:56.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's squeezing a cotton\Nball between his finger
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the coin to leak\Nliquid into the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.73,0:16:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So that's how he's gonna\Nmake the glass overflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.81,0:16:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he told me to watch for cheating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.87,0:16:05.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clever bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.35,0:16:07.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:19.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The glass has reached its limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One more coin and the booze will spill!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.77,0:16:22.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Victory is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:27.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he said, we'll see\Nwhich dance partner cries first!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.45,0:16:30.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, man, that was a close one!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.65,0:16:32.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought it was gonna spill for sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.53,0:16:35.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's your turn! Good luck, Obi!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.33,0:16:38.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Darby!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.49,0:16:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't make me say it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.31,0:16:42.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you my name is Darby, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.37,0:16:44.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not Obi, not Barbie. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.17,0:16:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:52.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's messing up his name on purpose to\Nget him riled up and throw off his game.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.39,0:16:54.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I gotta hand it to the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's a natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.81,0:16:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So what do you say we keep playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.95,0:17:01.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's your turn\Nto drop a coin in, Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.07,0:17:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shadow makes it\Ndifficult to see from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.87,0:17:17.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll lower the coin in from\Nthe right side of the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.15,0:17:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Drop it in from whatever angle you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.59,0:17:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What he doesn't know is the glass is already\Nat its limit thanks to my little trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.21,0:17:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way the liquid\Ncould take another coin, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.89,0:17:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the slightest touch\Nwill cause it to spill over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.43,0:17:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're probably thinking the\Nglass has reached its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.71,0:17:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That dropping in another\Ncoin would be impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.95,0:17:48.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you'd be wrong about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.69,0:18:00.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way. How the\Nhell did he do that? Why
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.45,0:18:03.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,didn't it spill over\Nyour questions confusing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.27,0:18:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean why\Ndidn't it spill you saw
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.01,0:18:10.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the result with your own\Neyes as far as i know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.15,0:18:12.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't do anything\Ndevious i was watching
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,him with star platinum\Nit's hard to believe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.59,0:18:17.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he dropped it in fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.83,0:18:18.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.61,0:18:21.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how did he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm positive I added enough liquid to the
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.29,0:18:26.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,glass and one more coin\Nwould make it spill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.65,0:18:27.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way it should have spilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.03,0:18:31.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make your move.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.87,0:18:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your turn, Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.65,0:18:35.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.15,0:18:38.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or are you trying to\Nwait until it evaporates?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.03,0:18:51.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This can't be happening!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.79,0:19:21.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Mr. Joestar!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.81,0:19:29.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Deep in his heart of hearts,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.53,0:19:33.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jostar had already come to the\Nrealization that he'd lost this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:36.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why his soul emerged easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, Darby, have won this\Nbet like all the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.89,0:19:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Polarify, I failed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.53,0:19:48.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ollie, I'm so sorry, my beautiful\Ngirl, but Daddy's let you down.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.79,0:19:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar! One man, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:03.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.41,0:20:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now let's continue where\Nwe left off. That is,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.73,0:20:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,unless you two have decided\Nto abandon your friends
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.17,0:20:12.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and slink away with your\Ntails between your legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.01,0:20:13.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.43,0:20:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't get it, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.21,0:20:22.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I keep trying to tell you that if you take\Nmy life, your friends will die with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.05,0:20:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.07,0:20:25.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Antal, stand down!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.35,0:20:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, if you're gonna cause trouble, then\NI'm gonna have to ask you to leave...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth and stay out of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.33,0:20:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.41,0:20:49.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've noticed it too late, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.09,0:20:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.00,0:20:52.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's wrong with the glass?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.95,0:20:56.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the reason the coin\Ndidn't make the boost spill over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.09,0:20:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you look at the bottom of the glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.11,0:21:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you'll see that there's a\Ntiny bit of chocolate on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.97,0:21:03.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have found a way to stick\Nit on when he was inspecting
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.83,0:21:07.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the glass and coins at the\Nvery beginning of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.57,0:21:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely you know the rules by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.25,0:21:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't count as cheating if\Nyou never get caught in the act.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.65,0:21:13.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.56,0:21:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.48,0:21:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could a piece of chocolate\Nallow him to drop in an extra coin?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.19,0:21:19.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, at this point, it's melted,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.07,0:21:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it used to be a solid chunk\Nstuck to the bottom of the glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.13,0:21:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just enough to slightly tilt the glass,
