Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.55,0:21:36.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With the glass leveled out,\Nthe booze began to settle,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.29,0:21:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which made enough room for another coin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.87,0:21:41.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.21,0:21:42.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.97,0:21:46.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could he have known the chocolate\Nwould melt right when he needed it to?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.87,0:21:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He influenced things by using the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.21,0:21:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It slipped my notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.23,0:21:53.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he moved to the\Nright side of the table,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.33,0:21:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he allowed the sun to shine\Ndirectly onto the chocolate,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.95,0:21:57.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,thereby melting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.21,0:22:08.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby, get your cards,\Nbecause we're playing my game.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.39,0:22:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hope you're ready for some poker.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.71,0:22:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:17.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Totoro!
