Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.47,0:23:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me three cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I think I'll raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.69,0:23:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't notice him do\Nanything suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.07,0:23:35.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Successful cheating requires\Nthe element of surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.79,0:23:37.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's only one Joker here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.21,0:23:38.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.83,0:23:41.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll bet my soul on the game's outcome.
